  "description": "Like a butterfly drawn to a flower, I paused, captivated by its beauty. Grasping the stem, I pulled with all my strength and broke off a single blossom. Though my lips barely touched it, my whole body felt feverishly hot. It spurted hot blood without pause. It couldn't possibly be this hot otherwise.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 24 extra chapters.*",
